    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/services/devtest-lab/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure DevTest Labs</a> is now available in Azure Government.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>With this availability, US government agencies and their partners can modernize their legacy infrastructure to build fast, easy, and lean environments.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>​To learn more, go to our <a href=\"https://blogs.msdn.microsoft.com/devtestlab/2018/04/04/announcing-azure-devtest-labs-in-azure-government/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">team blog</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "Azure DevTest Labs is now available in Azure Government.\n\nWith this availability, US government agencies and their partners can modernize their legacy infrastructure to build fast, easy, and lean environments.\n\n​To learn more, go to our team blog ."
